exports[`reviewWarmerFlag.acceptance given: [case1] a cadence past the cache ttl when: [t0] the driver runs it then: the refusal renders whole 1`] = `
"
🦉 woah there

✋ ConstraintError: --warmer "1x,90m" spaces pokes 90m apart, over the bound of 30m. a poke sent past the cache ttl refreshes naught and costs in full, so a wide cadence buys no coverage at any count. --warmer off | on | <k>x,<m>m   e.g. --warmer 5x,10m

✨ did you know?
   └─ run with --help for the --warmer plans

"
`;

