exports[`reviewWarmerFlag.acceptance given: [case3] a poke count over the bound when: [t0] the driver runs it then: the refusal renders whole 1`] = `
"
🦉 woah there

✋ ConstraintError: --warmer "100x,10m" asks for 100 pokes, over the bound of 12. a warmer spends unattended, so its worst case is bounded here rather than left to the caller. --warmer off | on | <k>x,<m>m   e.g. --warmer 5x,10m

✨ did you know?
   └─ run with --help for the --warmer plans

"
`;

